 "_what": "The ways out of the game to the people behind it, per product (docs/plans/110; the library's fable-plans/the-release-infrastructure-this-week, agent B, revised 2026-10-03). sponsor: the coffee button on the start card and the night's end card, the owner's GitHub Sponsors page (https://github.com/sponsors/<login> once enrolled); empty hides the button. catalog: the plants' catalog (the pulse's public half), its finer builds to buy, on the night's end card; empty shows 'Free at 1080; finer builds soon.'. Beside products.json, not in it: that file is the mechanics seat's (ops/seats.toml).",
