 "_what": "THE FIRST NIGHT'S GUIDE (docs/plans/030, 092, 095): the goals a newcomer's night shows, in the order the lesson would like, shown not told. Each goal is done on `done`, a condition on main.state() (TrCond), as a play's; once done it stays taught, but a goal that `keep`s comes back when the world takes it away (the fire out, the walker up). A goal's `action` (the guide's word: pick for either bush) is asked of the rules where its light is; when they refuse, the action that removes the reason is shown instead (TrNeeds.GIVERS) -- the fire out, it is fed, and wood gathered for it first. A goal with no action is shown as itself. `ends`: the goal whose doing ends the guide, whatever else is open (the fishing station reached: docs/plans/188, the night's end falls at the shore, so the morning wakes the walker, the camp is packed and the last step is to be there before dark; the evening's goals say `night_out.morning` false, so they are not shown again by day; the morning asks for breakfast and, on the walk, a bottle filled at the burn when it runs dry (docs/plans/224: chosen by the simulated walk, tools/sim/journey/transect-walk.toml); the goal that `welcomes` marks the onboarding done when it is: the night slept through). `after`: goals that come first, while they can be shown. Which goal: the one at hand (ACT offers it, or it is under way), else the fewest actions to it, else the lesson's order; none is ever dropped. How an action is shown -- `ring`: pack:<item or footer words> (the pack, then its cell, then ACT while placing); act_when:<action> (ACT once it offers that, else the stick); near:<ring> (the stick until at the light, then that); act; stick; tap -- and `beacon`, where its light stands: deadwood, camp, plant, fruit, water, fire, tent_spot, fire_spot, tent, bag. `shows`: how an action no goal names is shown. `ahead`: a step of the lesson, shown in the lesson's order whether its `when` holds or not, after the due goals that are not (the needs, the fire's lighting, bed), so the guide is never empty until the night is done; the evening comes while the fire waits for its due, and bed is due once the fire is lit, after every lesson that can still be shown (docs/plans/131; the owner: \"there should basically always be something to do\"); the fire's lighting, eating, lying down and sleep never come ahead. A NEED IS AN AMOUNT OVER A HORIZON (docs/plans/115; the owner: \"actually fulfil what is needed\"): gather is done when the night's wood is stacked (night_out.need.wood_kg, TrExpedition.needs: the fire from dusk to dawn, less what is carried and burning), drink when the bottle is full and the thirst gone; light comes `after` gather, so the night's wood is in before the fire is lit; tend feeds the fire before it dies. `gives_up`: a goal whose horizon cannot be met in the time left (no light left to gather the night's wood) is met as given up, and the guide's state names it (`short`) for its line -- never asked again, never looped. `when`: the condition that makes a goal due (TrCond, `any`/`all` allowed) -- the evening coming, the cold, thirst, an empty store: a goal is shown only once it is due, never ahead of it, and one done before it was due is done (docs/plans/105, fable-plans transect-for-friends-and-family step 3). `start_sun_deg`: the tutorial's night sets off where the sun stands so, late in the afternoon (TrScenario.tutorial, docs/plans/122): the tutorial sets its start hour, never the clock's pace. The clock is never held: the first night is a situation, not a lesson; the evening by the fire runs at the walk's own pace. `words` are the dev tools' line only.",
 "steps": [
  {
   "id": "gather",
   "ahead": true,
   "action": "gather",
   "ring": "act_when:gather",
   "beacon": "deadwood",
   "words": "Gather the night's wood",
   "when": {
    "all": [
     {
      "any": [
       {
        "path": "sun.elevation",
        "op": "<",
        "value": 12.0
       },
       {
        "path": "night_out.body.shiver_w",
        "op": ">",
        "value": 25
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "path": "night_out.morning",
      "op": "==",
      "value": false
     }
    ]
   },
   "done": {
    "path": "night_out.need.wood_kg",
    "op": "<=",
    "value": 0.0
   },
   "gives_up": {
    "path": "night_out.need.wood_meetable",
    "op": "==",
    "value": false
   },
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "id": "pitch",
   "ahead": true,
   "action": "pitch",
   "ring": "pack:tent",
   "beacon": "tent_spot",
   "words": "Pitch your tent at the light",
   "when": {
    "all": [
     {
      "any": [
       {
        "path": "sun.elevation",
        "op": "<",
        "value": 12.0
       },
       {
        "path": "clock.rain",
        "op": ">",
        "value": 0.5
       },
       {
        "path": "night_out.body.shiver_w",
        "op": ">",
        "value": 25
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "path": "night_out.morning",
      "op": "==",
      "value": false
     }
    ]
   },
   "done": {
    "path": "night_out.tent.pitched",
    "op": "==",
    "value": true
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "bag",
   "ahead": true,
   "action": "lay_out_bag",
   "ring": "pack:bag",
   "beacon": "tent",
   "words": "Lay your bag in the tent",
   "after": [
    "pitch"
   ],
   "when": {
    "all": [
     {
      "any": [
       {
        "path": "sun.elevation",
        "op": "<",
        "value": 12.0
       },
       {
        "path": "clock.rain",
        "op": ">",
        "value": 0.5
       },
       {
        "path": "night_out.body.shiver_w",
        "op": ">",
        "value": 25
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "path": "night_out.morning",
      "op": "==",
      "value": false
     }
    ]
   },
   "done": {
    "path": "night_out.out.bag.distance_m",
    "op": ">=",
    "value": 0
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "drink",
   "ahead": true,
   "action": "drink",
   "ring": "act_when:drink",
   "beacon": "water",
   "words": "Fill your bottle at the stream",
   "when": {
    "any": [
     {
      "all": [
       {
        "path": "night_out.body.water_deficit_l",
        "op": ">=",
        "value": 0.7
       },
       {
        "path": "night_out.pack.water_l",
        "op": "<",
        "value": 0.05
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "all": [
       {
        "path": "sun.elevation",
        "op": "<",
        "value": 8.0
       },
       {
        "path": "night_out.need.water_short",
        "op": "==",
        "value": true
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   "done": {
    "path": "night_out.need.water_short",
    "op": "==",
    "value": false
   },
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "id": "sip",
   "action": "drink_bottle",
   "ring": "pack:water",
   "beacon": "",
   "words": "Drink from your bottle",
   "keep": true,
   "when": {
    "path": "night_out.body.water_deficit_l",
    "op": ">=",
    "value": 0.7
   },
   "done": {
    "path": "night_out.body.water_deficit_l",
    "op": "<",
    "value": 0.1
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "pick",
   "ahead": true,
   "action": "pick",
   "ring": "act_when:pick",
   "beacon": "fruit",
   "words": "Pick berries",
   "when": {
    "all": [
     {
      "any": [
       {
        "path": "sun.elevation",
        "op": "<",
        "value": 12.0
       },
       {
        "path": "night_out.body.glycogen_kcal",
        "op": "<",
        "value": 1500
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "path": "night_out.morning",
      "op": "==",
      "value": false
     }
    ]
   },
   "done": {
    "path": "night_out.pack.berries_g",
    "op": ">",
    "value": 0
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "inspect",
   "ahead": true,
   "ring": "tap",
   "beacon": "plant",
   "words": "Tap a tree to see what it is",
   "when": {
    "path": "walker.from_start_m",
    "op": ">=",
    "value": 15.0
   },
   "done": {
    "path": "inspect.shown",
    "op": "!=",
    "value": ""
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "lay",
   "ahead": true,
   "action": "lay",
   "ring": "pack:wood",
   "beacon": "fire_spot",
   "words": "Lay a fire by the tent, at the light",
   "after": [
    "pitch"
   ],
   "when": {
    "all": [
     {
      "any": [
       {
        "path": "sun.elevation",
        "op": "<",
        "value": 8.0
       },
       {
        "path": "night_out.body.shiver_w",
        "op": ">",
        "value": 25
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "path": "night_out.morning",
      "op": "==",
      "value": false
     }
    ]
   },
   "done": {
    "path": "night_out.fire.laid",
    "op": "==",
    "value": true
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "light",
   "action": "light",
   "ring": "act_when:light",
   "beacon": "fire",
   "words": "Light it",
   "keep": true,
   "when": {
    "all": [
     {
      "path": "night_out.lying",
      "op": "==",
      "value": false
     },
     {
      "any": [
       {
        "path": "sun.elevation",
        "op": "<",
        "value": 5.0
       },
       {
        "path": "night_out.body.shiver_w",
        "op": ">",
        "value": 25
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "path": "night_out.morning",
      "op": "==",
      "value": false
     }
    ]
   },
   "done": {
    "path": "night_out.fire.lit",
    "op": "==",
    "value": true
   },
   "after": [
    "gather"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "tend",
   "action": "feed",
   "ring": "act_when:feed",
   "beacon": "fire",
   "words": "Feed the fire before it dies",
   "keep": true,
   "when": {
    "all": [
     {
      "path": "night_out.fire.lit",
      "op": "==",
      "value": true
     },
     {
      "path": "night_out.fire.fuel_kg",
      "op": "<",
      "value": 1.5
     },
     {
      "path": "night_out.lying",
      "op": "==",
      "value": false
     },
     {
      "path": "night_out.morning",
      "op": "==",
      "value": false
     }
    ]
   },
   "done": {
    "any": [
     {
      "path": "night_out.fire.fuel_kg",
      "op": ">=",
      "value": 1.5
     },
     {
      "path": "night_out.fire.lit",
      "op": "==",
      "value": false
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "eat",
   "action": "eat_berries",
   "ring": "pack:berries",
   "beacon": "fire",
   "words": "Eat the berries by the fire",
   "after": [
    "light"
   ],
   "when": {
    "all": [
     {
      "any": [
       {
        "path": "night_out.body.glycogen_kcal",
        "op": "<",
        "value": 1500
       },
       {
        "path": "night_out.fire.lit",
        "op": "==",
        "value": true
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "path": "night_out.morning",
      "op": "==",
      "value": false
     }
    ]
   },
   "done": {
    "path": "night_out.body.eaten_kcal",
    "op": ">",
    "value": 0
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "dusk",
   "ahead": true,
   "ring": "",
   "beacon": "fire",
   "words": "The evening comes",
   "after": [
    "gather",
    "pitch",
    "bag",
    "drink",
    "pick",
    "inspect",
    "lay"
   ],
   "when": {
    "all": [
     {
      "path": "sun.elevation",
      "op": "<",
      "value": 2.0
     },
     {
      "path": "night_out.morning",
      "op": "==",
      "value": false
     }
    ]
   },
   "done": {
    "path": "sun.elevation",
    "op": "<",
    "value": -1.0
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "lie",
   "action": "lie",
   "ring": "near:pack:Lie down",
   "beacon": "bag",
   "words": "Lie down on your bag",
   "after": [
    "gather",
    "pitch",
    "bag",
    "drink",
    "pick",
    "inspect",
    "lay",
    "light",
    "eat"
   ],
   "keep": true,
   "when": {
    "all": [
     {
      "any": [
       {
        "path": "sun.elevation",
        "op": "<",
        "value": -1.0
       },
       {
        "path": "night_out.body.sleep_pressure",
        "op": ">",
        "value": 0.75
       },
       {
        "path": "night_out.fire.lit",
        "op": "==",
        "value": true
